  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>避難者カード【ネパール</text:p>
      <text:p>उदाहरण　　　 शिविर कार्ड（आगाडिको भाग）　　　【様式－७】</text:p>
      <text:p>मिति　　साल　　महिना　　दिन　 कृपया प्रत्येक घरको लागि सूची बनाउनुहोस्।</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="मुख्य विवरण" table:style-name="Grid">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>शिविर मिति र समय</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>साल</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>महिना</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>दिन</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>समय</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>समूह－ नम्बर.</text:p><text:p>－</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>शिविर केन्द्र</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>निकास स्थल　・ घर ・ अत्रैत्र （　　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>※गाडीमा बसोबास गर्नुहुनेलो, कृपया पार्किङको स्थान लेख्नुहोस्</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>छिमेकी संघको नाम</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>※ बासिन्दा संघमा सामेल नभएकाहरूले “सामेल नभएको” भनेर लेख्नुहोस्।</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="BoldCell"><text:p>शिविर मा भएकोव्यक्ति विवरण गोला लगाउनुहोस्</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>कतागाना नाम</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>उमेर</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>लिंग</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>नाता</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>नोट* विशेष हेरचाह आवश्यक पर्ने व्यक्तिको संख्या वर्णन गर्नुहोस्</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>(मुख्य व्यक्ति)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>वर्ष</text:p></table:table-cell>
